  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Explanation : **\n\nInterchanging the numbers and signs by using BODMAS rule,\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nOption 1) 15 and 35; × and ÷\n\n15 + 35 – __**4 ÷ 45× 5 **__= 98\n\n__**15 + 35**__ - 0.444 = 98\n\n__**50 - 0.444**__ = 98\n\n49.56 ≠ 98 ( LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 35 and 45; × and –\n\n45 + __**15 × 4 **__- __**35 ÷ 5**__ = 98\n\n__**45 + 60 **__- 7 = 98\n\n**__105 - 7__** = 98\n\n98 = 98 ( LHS = RHS )\n\nOption 3) 35 and 45; + and –\n\n45 - 15 + __**4 × 35 ÷ 5 **__= 98\n\n__**45**__ - 15 __**+ 28**__ = 98\n\n__**73 - 15**__ = 98\n\n58≠ 98 ( LHS ≠ RHS) \n\nOption 4 ) 15 and 5; × and +\n\n35 + __**5 × 4**__ - __**45 ÷ 15**__ = 98\n\n__**35 + 20**__ - 3 = 98\n\n__**55 - 3**__ = 98\n\n52 ≠ 98 ( LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **Option 2)** is the correct answer.",
